Usage: rtok graph export [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>      User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --level <LEVEL>      `overview` is projects and links; `symbols` adds every symbol and call
                           [default: overview] [possible values: overview, symbols]
      --focus <FOCUS>      Only the symbols within `--depth` calls of this one, callers and callees
      --depth <DEPTH>      Calls to follow from `--focus` [default: 2]
